file "four_script.sp" deck
  title "four_script"
  comment " oracle: ngspice-45 fourier.c:69 (cp_getvar nfreqs: a script set gives the count; the set is an option from its place on, R49 ii, and a count-less Four reads the deck-wide nfreqs only)"
